# ============================================================
# AIW-ORG .GITIGNORE (L2.3 — fixed 2026-09-01)
# ============================================================
# Runtime artifacts that change every cron tick:
# We don't track these in git. The canonical state lives in:
#   - /opt/data/state/         (live runtime)
#   - state-versioned repo     (auto-snapshot every hour)
#   - agent's PROMPT.md body   (the agent definition)
#
# L2.3 fix: replaced `*/X` with `**/X` for nested-dir matching
# Old:  */outbox/*.md      → only matched files directly in X/outbox/*.md
# New:  **/outbox/*.md     → matches files in any nested X/outbox/*.md
# git's `*/` only matches a SINGLE directory level; `**/` matches any depth

# Per-agent runtime output (outbox at any depth)
**/outbox/*.md
**/outbox/*.bak
**/outbox/.tick-*
**/outbox/.scan_snapshot.json
**/outbox/.chaos_test_last_run
**/outbox/.last-tick.json*
**/outbox/_last-tick.json*
**/outbox/.daily.bak

# Per-agent monitor notes (at any depth)
**/monitor-notes/*.md
**/monitor-notes/.coord-mirror-pre-*.bak
**/monitor-notes/.funding-mirror-pre-*.bak
**/monitor-notes/*.pre-tick-*.bak

# Per-agent runtime state inside agent dirs
**/state/state.json
**/state/state.jsonl
**/state/*.bak

# Live state backups (root-level .pre-sqlite.bak etc)
*.pre-sqlite.bak
*.pre-fire*

# Runtime tick state (anywhere)
*.chaos.last_run

# State mirrors
.state-mirror-pre-*

# State history (auto-snapshotted to state-versioned repo)
state/history/
state/snapshots/
state/org-state.json.bak
state/coaching-customers/
state/*.mirror-pre-*.bak
state/*.pre-*.bak
state/*.bak

# Env files (anywhere — but not aiw-org's own .env.example files)
.env
.env.*
!**/.env.example
!**/.env.sample
!**/.envrc

# OS / Editor
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
*.swp
*.swo
.vscode/
.idea/

# Python
__pycache__/
*.pyc

# Node
node_modules/
.next/
dist/

# OS-specific
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
